/T (The internship covered in this report was completed in the Data Analyst domain through a structured six-week online internship program. The program combined weekly learning modules with practical assignments and an end-to-end capstone project, allowing the concepts covered during training to be applied to datasets and analytical tasks. The program was conducted under the guidance of Ms. Simranjeet Kaur, Founder & Program Head, with the internship completion certificate awarded after the required coursework and capstone activities were successfully completed.)
/E (The internship covered in this report was completed in the Data Analyst domain through a structured six-week online internship program. The program combined weekly learning modules with practical assignments and an end-to-end capstone project, allowing the concepts covered during training to be applied to datasets and analytical tasks. The program was conducted under the guidance of Ms. Simranjeet Kaur, Founder & Program Head, with the internship completion certificate awarded after the required coursework and capstone activities were successfully completed.)
