/T (This process was implemented through different practical activities during the internship. In Excel, a large sales dataset was summarized using Pivot Tables to obtain meaningful business metrics. Python and Pandas were used to inspect a transactional dataset and perform data-cleaning operations on an exercise-tracking dataset containing missing and duplicate records. During the Week 4 capstone project, a sales transaction dataset was taken through data cleaning, validation, exploratory analysis, KPI evaluation, and business interpretation to develop meaningful findings and stakeholder-oriented recommendations.)
