/E (As part of the practical assignment, the Global Superstore Orders dataset was analyzed through Pivot Table-based sales summaries. The dataset consisted of approximately 51,290 records and 24 columns. The category-wise analysis presented in Figure 4.2 indicated that Technology generated the highest sales of approximately $4.74 million, followed by Furniture with around $4.11 million and Office Supplies with approximately $3.79 million.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [29]
>>
