/Title (Following the data-cleaning process, the Date column, which was initially stored in an inconsistent text format, was converted into an appropriate datetime format. The single missing Date value was handled through interpolation, while the two missing Calories entries were replaced using the mean of the column. After these steps, the dataset contained no missing values. A new calculated field, Calories_Per_Minute, was then generated by dividing Calories by Duration for each record. After removing the duplicate row and adding the derived column, the resulting dataset contained 31 rows and 6 columns and was saved as cleaned_data.csv.)
